  "details": "With the redesign, the list of friends in the Wings menu has become very difficult to read for me:\n\n- Font size too small: especially for the Status message, which is so small that I'm squinting to read it now\n\n- Same font colors: the old friends list used a different color for friend name vs. status. It was much more scannable. Now that they're both white, it's hard to distinguish, there's a loss in hierarchy\n\n- Status indicator too small: same deal, it just feels so much harder to see who's green/blue/orange when the dot indicator is so tiny now",
